{
    "title": "3pt Contest: Basketball Games",
    "description": "<u>SPORTS GAMES WITH MANY LEVELS, MISSIONS, DAILY CHALLENGES AND 10 LEAGUES! </u>\r\n\r\nWould you like to be a star of basketball games? Webelinx basketball simulator has a new game mode for true sports games fans - compete in leagues and play 1v1 duels to win incredible prizes! Be the champion of the most exciting 3 point contest in the world of mobile basketball games! Shoot hoops in <b>3 Point Basketball Contest: 1v1 Sports Games</b>, an amazing basketball simulator for true fans of the game!\r\n\r\n<b>10 BASKETBALL LEAGUES TO COMPETE IN</b>\r\n\r\n9 regional leagues + a worldwide basketball championship for the top basketball players!\r\nA chance to win unique customization items in each league - climb to the top of the leaderboard and walk off with a special set, ball & mask\r\nImprove your shooting skills, win 1vs1 basket battles and unlock all leagues\r\nBattle it out on the court - shoot 3 pointers simultaneously with your opponent\r\nSpecial rewards include in-game cash, boosters, and customization items\r\nNot happy with your performance? Replay the league, improve your ranking and become a basketball champion!\r\n\r\n<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\nREALISTIC 3D environments - play street basketball games and shoot 3-pointers on more than 25 unique basketball courts in major world cities\r\nFULLY CUSTOMIZABLE PLAYER - you can customize your player\u2019s appearance from head to toe: jerseys, sneakers, wraps, bands, masks, and more\r\nCHALLENGING MISSIONS - each level comes with 3 missions you must complete to advance to the next level\r\nDAY AND NIGHT MODE - once you pass all levels during the day, more challenges await in the night mode!\r\nBOOSTERS, SETS, AND BONUSES - step up your game with booster items and shoot for that basket with confidence!\r\nDAILY MISSIONS offer extra practice in shooting hoops, as well as more experience points and rewards!\r\n<b>Shooting Hoops - 3 Point Basketball Games</b> IS FREE TO PLAY!\r\n\r\n<b>1v1 SPORTS GAMES</b>\r\n\r\nDo you miss the competitiveness of sports games and the adrenaline rush that comes with winning 1v1 battles on the basketball court? Webelinx basketball games for free offer the most incredible 3 point contest for your mobile phone! Our basketball simulation games are designed for true fans of sports games, as well as those who seek a \u201cstay at home\u201d pastime activity. \r\n\r\n<b>BASKETBALL SIMULATOR WITH AN OFFLINE PRACTICE MODE!</b>\r\n\r\nTake a deep breath and shoot for the hoop - just like in real life, there\u2019s a minute on the clock and you must make as many baskets as you can to win and become a basketball star! Once you feel the thrill of shooting hoops around the world, there\u2019s no going back - you will be hooked on this competitive basketball game!\r\n\r\nDownload this fun and free basketball simulator game by Webelinx NOW and let us know what you think. All feedback is appreciated!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<u>SPORTS GAMES WITH MANY LEVELS, MISSIONS, DAILY CHALLENGES AND 10 LEAGUES! </u><br><br>Would you like to be a star of basketball games? Webelinx basketball simulator has a new game mode for true sports games fans - compete in leagues and play 1v1 duels to win incredible prizes! Be the champion of the most exciting 3 point contest in the world of mobile basketball games! Shoot hoops in <b>3 Point Basketball Contest: 1v1 Sports Games</b>, an amazing basketball simulator for true fans of the game!<br><br><b>10 BASKETBALL LEAGUES TO COMPETE IN</b><br><br>9 regional leagues + a worldwide basketball championship for the top basketball players!<br>A chance to win unique customization items in each league - climb to the top of the leaderboard and walk off with a special set, ball &amp; mask<br>Improve your shooting skills, win 1vs1 basket battles and unlock all leagues<br>Battle it out on the court - shoot 3 pointers simultaneously with your opponent<br>Special rewards include in-game cash, boosters, and customization items<br>Not happy with your performance? Replay the league, improve your ranking and become a basketball champion!<br><br><b>KEY FEATURES:</b><br><br>REALISTIC 3D environments - play street basketball games and shoot 3-pointers on more than 25 unique basketball courts in major world cities<br>FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE PLAYER - you can customize your player\u2019s appearance from head to toe: jerseys, sneakers, wraps, bands, masks, and more<br>CHALLENGING MISSIONS - each level comes with 3 missions you must complete to advance to the next level<br>DAY AND NIGHT MODE - once you pass all levels during the day, more challenges await in the night mode!<br>BOOSTERS, SETS, AND BONUSES - step up your game with booster items and shoot for that basket with confidence!<br>DAILY MISSIONS offer extra practice in shooting hoops, as well as more experience points and rewards!<br><b>Shooting Hoops - 3 Point Basketball Games</b> IS FREE TO PLAY!<br><br><b>1v1 SPORTS GAMES</b><br><br>Do you miss the competitiveness of sports games and the adrenaline rush that comes with winning 1v1 battles on the basketball court? Webelinx basketball games for free offer the most incredible 3 point contest for your mobile phone! Our basketball simulation games are designed for true fans of sports games, as well as those who seek a \u201cstay at home\u201d pastime activity. <br><br><b>BASKETBALL SIMULATOR WITH AN OFFLINE PRACTICE MODE!</b><br><br>Take a deep breath and shoot for the hoop - just like in real life, there\u2019s a minute on the clock and you must make as many baskets as you can to win and become a basketball star! Once you feel the thrill of shooting hoops around the world, there\u2019s no going back - you will be hooked on this competitive basketball game!<br><br>Download this fun and free basketball simulator game by Webelinx NOW and let us know what you think. All feedback is appreciated!",
